{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Change an AI employee's settings, for every product or, with appId, for one product only (for example \"raise the reach bar to 2%\"). values maps a setting key from get_employee_settings to an integer within its range or one of its choices' values; with appId, null removes that product's own value so the setting for every product applies again. A value outside a setting's range or choices, or a key the role does not have, is refused and nothing changes. Only the person who hired it or a workspace admin can. No cost to call. Use when the user asks to change how an AI employee works.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"appId":{"description":"Only this product's value; leave it out to change the setting for every product.","maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"employeeId":{"description":"Employee id from list_employees.","type":"string"},"values":{"additionalProperties":true,"description":"Setting key (from get_employee_settings) -> integer value; null, with appId, removes that product's own value.","properties":{},"type":"object"}},"required":["employeeId","values"],"type":"object"},"name":"update_employee_settings","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":true,"properties":{"appId":{"anyOf":[{"readOnly":true,"type":"string"},{"type":"number"},{"type":"boolean"},{"type":"null"}]},"employee":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":true,"properties":{},"type":"object"},{"type":"null"}]},"note":{"anyOf":[{"readOnly":true,"type":"string"},{"type":"number"},{"type":"boolean"},{"type":"null"}]},"settings":{"anyOf":[{"items":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":true,"properties":{"default":{"anyOf":[{"readOnly":true,"type":"string"},{"type":"number"},{"type":"boolean